"""Phone-only (<=600px) layout for the language-selection page. Desktop/tablet CSS is untouched.

V292.1: the services preview is shown whole (sidebar, search, four tiles, shield badge) and the language
card overlaps only its lower edge, so the idea of the desktop picture survives on a phone and the page fits
about one screen."""
